```text
Components: PascalCase (Header.tsx, ChartArea.tsx)
Hooks: camelCase with use prefix (useStockData.ts)
Types/Interfaces: PascalCase (StockInfo, OHLCData)
Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for true constants
Functions: camelCase (fetchStockData)
Files: Match default export name (Header.tsx exports Header)
CSS Classes: Tailwind utility classes, custom classes in kebab-case
API Routes: kebab-case (/api/stocks/:symbol/ohlc)
